From 63a19078bee4079307a1d56f58c3ae25750579b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:10:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add allotment, flower and herb patches at Catherby and
 Falador

Rake, plant with a seed dibber, growth on the farming clock (allotments every
10 minutes, flowers 5, herbs 20, also while logged out) and harvest with the
OSRS Wiki's harvest lives, chance-to-save constants and XP. Each patch's state
is the farming_transmit value the patch multilocs show (and RuneLite's Time
Tracking reads), written to farming_transmit_a-d while the player is in that
farm's area. New module content/skills/farming with the server-only dbtable
farming_crops (60002, rows 60160-60187), server varps 63780-63795, timer
farming_transmit (460) and ::growpatches. Integration tests in
FarmingScriptTest. No disease, compost, watering, payments, weed regrowth or
tool leprechaun.
